{"id":"vod_sn_35893","vodId":"35893","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"日本国有铁道公安队","name_cn":"日本国有铁道公安队","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/fec4772e865d4ed23875e2c9791a82d9.jpg"},"summary":"在平行世界的日本，铁道国有化根深蒂固。就读于桐生铁道高中的高山直人（福山润 配音）梦想进入国铁担任火车司机，从此过上安安稳稳的生活。为此他进入学生铁道OJT参加培训，并在此结识了性格过激的暴力女樱井葵（沼仓爱美 配音）和头脑简单四肢发达的岩泉翔（日野聪 配音）等人。好不容易通过了OJT的测试，结果直人他们却被分配到了东京中央铁路公安室第四警戒班。原来国铁长期赤字，许多地方线路长期废弃。为此有很多组织以极端的手段要求国家将铁路实现民营化，于是铁道公安队应运而生。直人他们成为铁路上不可或缺的重要存在……　　本片根据丰田巧的轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iiYbbB8RZF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2Md5XP2Ev71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5vfTcU1Uju1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z20xebd68q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cwUig7JF7r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NuNnH3pGeG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3yhJN71kpx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vz7BeJbQKV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0a00LvXstA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aR8asntTXF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gLdp2UGtdg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bwRsn8bEQZ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:29.691Z"}